# {{.Type}}: {{.Name}}

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Provider-defined functions need Terraform 1.8 or later, or OpenTofu 1.7 or later, and a `required_providers` entry for `blechschmidt/sysutils`; call it as `provider::sysutils::{{.Name}}(...)`. It is pure: it only parses its argument, never reads files or looks at the host, so its result is the same during plan and apply. Use `file()` or the [`sysutils_file`](../data-sources/file.md) data source to read the input.

